,"parts":[{"text":"இறடி","lemma":"இறடி","gloss":"millet"}],"gloss":"millet"},{"surface":"காக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கா","lemma":"கா","gloss":"to guard"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"க்கும்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"guarding"},{"surface":"புறம்","parts":[{"text":"புறம்","lemma":"புறம்","gloss":"back"}],"gloss":"back"},{"surface":"தாழ்","parts":[{"text":"தாழ்","lemma":"தாழ்","gloss":"hanging down"}],"gloss":"hanging down"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"சில்","parts":[{"text":"சில்","lemma":"சில்","gloss":"fine"}],"gloss":"fine"},{"surface":"ஓதி","parts":[{"text":"ஓதி","lemma":"ஓதி","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"அசை","parts":[{"text":"அசை","lemma":"அசை","gloss":"swaying"}],"gloss":"swaying"},{"surface":"இயல்","parts":[{"text":"இயல்","lemma":"இயல்","gloss":"nature"}],"gloss":"nature"},{"surface":"கொடிச்சி","parts":[{"text":"கொடிச்சி","lemma":"கொடிச்சி","gloss":"mountain girl"}],"gloss":"mountain girl"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திருந்து","parts":[{"text":"திருந்து","lemma":"திருந்து","gloss":"well-fashioned"}],"gloss":"well-fashioned"},{"surface":"இழை","parts":[{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"jewels"}],"gloss":"jewels"},{"surface":"அல்குற்கு","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"அல்குல்","gloss":"loins"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the loins"},{"surface":"பெருந்தழை","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தழை","lemma":"பெருந்தழை","gloss":"large leaf-garment"}],"gloss":"large leaf-garment","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உதவி","parts":[{"text":"உதவி","lemma":"உதவி","gloss":"having given"}],"gloss":"having given"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செயலை","parts":[{"text":"செயலை","lemma":"செயலை","gloss":"Aśoka tree"}],"gloss":"Aśoka tree"},{"surface":"முழுமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"முழு","lemma":"முழு","gloss":"entire"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"முதல்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"entire trunk"},{"surface":"ஒழிய","parts":[{"text":"ஒழி","lemma":"ஒழி","gloss":"to strip bare"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to be stripped bare"},{"surface":"அயல","parts":[{"text":"அயல்","lemma":"அயல்","gloss":"nearby"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"neuter plural suffix"}],"gloss":"nearby"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தரலை","parts":[{"text":"தரலை","lemma":"தரலை","gloss":"taralai flowers"}],"gloss":"taralai flowers"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"சூட்டி","parts":[{"text":"சூட்டு","lemma":"சூட்டு","gloss":"to adorn"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having adorned"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஏமுற்றன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஏமுற்றன்று","lemma":"ஏமுற்றன்று","gloss":"has become bewildered"}],"gloss":"has become bewildered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இவ்","parts":[{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"அழுங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"அழுங்கல்","lemma":"அழுங்கல்","gloss":"noisy"}],"gloss":"noisy"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"village"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"village indeed"}]}],"literal":"Tree-cutting forest-man, having cleared the upland field, sowed / prominent-eared millet, guarding, falling on her back / beautiful, fine hair, swaying-natured mountain girl's / well-fashioned jewels-adorned loins, giving a large leaf-garment, / leaving the Aśoka tree's entire trunk stripped bare, and nearby / taralai flowers garland having adorned, / has become bewildered, this noisy village.","translation":"The forest-man who cuts down trees cleared the upland field and sowed millet. Guarding that millet with its prominent ears is the mountain girl of swaying gait, whose beautiful, fine hair falls down her back. To cover her loins adorned with well-fashioned jewels, he gave her a large garment of leaves, stripping the Aśoka tree's trunk completely bare, and adorned her with a garland of nearby taralai flowers. Seeing this, this noisy village has become utterly bewildered.","modern":"மரங்களை வெட்டும் கானவன் புனத்தைத் திருத்தி விதைத்த, விளங்குகின்ற கதிர்களையுடைய தினையைக் காக்கின்றவள், முதுகில் தாழும் அழகிய சிலவாகிய கூந்தலையும் அசையும் தன்மையையும் உடைய குறமகள் ஆவாள். அவளுடைய திருந்திய அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த அல்குலுக்குப் பெரிய தழையாடையைத் தந்து உதவுவதற்காக, அசோக மரத்தின் அடிமரம் முழுவதும் இலைகளின்றி ஒழியுமாறு பறித்து, பக்கத்திலுள்ள தரலை மலர் மாலையையும் அவளுக்குச் சூட்டியதைக் கண்டு, இந்த ஆரவாரமுடைய ஊர் மயக்கம் அடைந்துள்ளது.","explanation":"In this Kuriñci poem, the friend (tōḻi) speaks about the gossip (alar) spreading in the village regarding the secret love between the hero and the heroine. She describes the heroine as a mountain girl (koṭicci) guarding the millet field, whose beautiful hair falls down her back. The hero has presented her with a lush leaf-garment (taḻai) made by stripping an entire Aśoka tree (ceyalai) bare, and adorned her with a garland of nearby taralai flowers. Seeing her wearing these gifts, which clearly reveal the hero's intimate affection, the noisy village (aḻuṅkal ūr) has become highly excited and bewildered. The imagery of stripping the tree bare to clothe her highlights the intensity of the hero's love, while the village's reaction signals the urgency for the hero to formalize their marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.07],[1.07,1.8],[1.8,2.1],[2.1,3.1],[3.1,3.27],[3.27,3.63],[3.63,4.07],[4.07,4.34],[4.34,4.51],[4.51,4.96],[4.96,5.31],[5.31,5.76],[5.76,6.29],[6.29,9.1],[9.1,9.5],[9.5,10.3],[10.3,10.7],[10.7,10.9],[10.9,11.65],[11.65,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.9],[13.98,14.37],[14.37,14.66],[14.66,14.93]],"female":[[0.0,0.45],[0.45,0.8],[0.8,1.52],[1.52,1.88],[1.88,2.5],[2.5,2.8],[2.8,3.42],[3.42,4.21],[4.21,4.67],[4.67,4.99],[4.99,5.77],[5.77,6.39],[6.39,7.17],[7.17,8.11],[8.11,9.8],[9.8,10.2],[10.2,10.53],[10.53,11.07],[11.07,11.4],[11.4,11.85],[11.85,12.72],[12.72,13.3],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,14.58],[14.86,15.19],[15.19,15.53],[15.53,15.83]]},"sync":[[["மரம்","tree"],["கொல்","cutting"]],[["கானவன்","forest-man"]],[["புனம்","upland field"],["துளர்ந்து","having cleared"]],[["வித்திய","sown"]],[["பிறங்கு","prominent"],["குரல்","ear of grain"]],[["இறடி","millet"]],[["காக்கும்","guarding"]],[["புறம்","back"],["தாழ்","hanging down"]],[["அம்","beautiful"],["சில்","fine"]],[["சில்","fine"],["ஓதி","hair"]],[["அசை","swaying"],["இயல்","nature"]],[["கொடிச்சி","mountain girl"]],[["திருந்து","well-fashioned"],["இழை","jewels"]],[["அல்குற்கு","to the loins"]],[["பெருந்தழை","large leaf-garment"]],[["உதவி","having given"]],[["செயலை","Aśoka tree"]],[["முழுமுதல்","entire trunk"]],[["ஒழிய","to be stripped bare"]],[["அயல","nearby"]],[["தரலை","taralai flowers"]],[["மாலை","garland"]],[["சூட்டி","having adorned"]],[["ஏமுற்றன்று","has become bewildered"]],[["ஏமுற்றன்று","has become bewildered"],["இவ்","this"]],[["அழுங்கல்","noisy"]],[["அழுங்கல்","noisy"],["ஊரே","village indeed"]]]}